{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"secret","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A percent-encoded credential in a filename is recoverable from persisted refusal diagnostics, but the scenario requires an agent to place a credential in that form and trigger the decoding limit."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"secret","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A filename with a terminal escape embedded in a private string exposes the normalized private string in persisted audit findings and feedback."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"unusual","reason":"Quadratic diagnosis blocks the daemon for seconds on an unusually large refused change, delaying work without demonstrated loss or an incorrect publication decision."}]}